WEBVTT

00:31:58.397 --> 00:32:02.197
And I think that a lot of people
convince themselves of that.

00:32:02.576 --> 00:32:05.824
AG: You know, I'm not asking you
to criticize a particular leader,

00:32:05.848 --> 00:32:08.086
but when you think about the culture

00:32:08.110 --> 00:32:11.340
it seems like there are aspects
of the culture

00:32:11.364 --> 00:32:13.594
that fit more with taking than giving

00:32:13.618 --> 00:32:15.747
and that there was some selfish

00:32:15.771 --> 00:32:18.339
as opposed to servant
leadership at the top.

00:32:19.541 --> 00:32:23.580
DF: Yeah look,
I think he was superfocused

00:32:23.604 --> 00:32:25.881
on delivering what he set out to do.

00:32:28.419 --> 00:32:31.370
I think he worked harder
than probably most people I've met.